/*
 * third_party.dox: Groups the vendored code in the documentation (Doxygen reads this file only: it is not compiled).
 *
 * Copyright (C) 2026 ErnstTechnik and the CoreLR contributors -- GPL-3.0-or-later.
 *
 * Doxygen reads `third_party/` as it is, so that the documentation holds what the image is built with. The code is not ours: its comments are not maintained here
 * and its Doxygen warnings are counted apart (`tools/analysis/doc_warnings.py`, "external"), never as errors. Each file is put in its group below with a
 * `@file <path>` + `@ingroup` block; a new vendored file that is not listed here still appears, ungrouped (tests/tools/test_doxygen.py says so).
 * The SPI library and sdfat are in the SD image only (as in `third_party/CMakeLists.txt`): their group is defined in `third_party_sd.dox`, which only the SD documentation reads.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup CoreLR_ThirdParty Third-party code
 * Vendored code under its own licence, with a `PROVENANCE.md` each (`third_party/`, `THIRD_PARTY.md`): what the image is built with, read as it is.
 */

